    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "coordinator",
        "speaker": "Coordinator",
        "sourceStart": 13,
        "sourceEnd": 298,
        "text": "Thanks for helping with next month's pottery workshop, Ben. The original plan was to use the upstairs studio, but the lift will be serviced that week. We have booked the ground-floor dining room instead. We can move the tables, and everyone will be able to get in without using stairs.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "122b65bbaca659661b60879c68d39d98a0f192256195f65b3288094ef1799aec",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 304,
        "sourceEnd": 337,
        "text": "Are we keeping the original date?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "79feed50ff329e4e7f4fc927cd012414863b3070e6ad9c05991fd1a764ee0351",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "coordinator",
        "speaker": "Coordinator",
        "sourceStart": 351,
        "sourceEnd": 537,
        "text": "Yes, Saturday the fourteenth. The session starts at ten, but helpers should arrive at nine to protect the floor. Please bring old towels. Plastic sheets slide too easily on this surface.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "642ae02d4fc256204c8f33d47220514a9673f5184429f477e1d1784348422759",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 543,
        "sourceEnd": 570,
        "text": "How many people can attend?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "dfa8245f75a12b055e1ca4ce4be7ae85d3f9816453009ec12c9be055cd12f46a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "coordinator",
        "speaker": "Coordinator",
        "sourceStart": 584,
        "sourceEnd": 800,
        "text": "The room can hold twenty, but the tutor wants a maximum of twelve beginners so that she can check everyone's technique. We have nine bookings so far. Do not advertise twenty places just because we have twenty chairs.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "f8fe1bf95d7b4e3e59ac5768a57ade060e599f261ad9a6d1411c070c4d0f21b0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 806,
        "sourceEnd": 828,
        "text": "What will people make?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "fb789d1473d16c592bf195dbbf43404cefe670472ee5b0efd9d36cfd2f24ca88",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "coordinator",
        "speaker": "Coordinator",
        "sourceStart": 842,
        "sourceEnd": 1045,
        "text": "A small bowl. We considered mugs, but handles need more time than we have. The tutor will demonstrate first, and then people will work on their own pieces. They must wear closed shoes. We provide aprons.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "1b9b49c285e232b6ed28663d6b12ce1b3f2b74ee6621a48af4fdcd741336016a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1051,
        "sourceEnd": 1089,
        "text": "Can they take the bowls home that day?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "801f359f57aaf5821c099397a2b3f6b73d5a1d6e53be901c0e2ce080666006fd",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "coordinator",
        "speaker": "Coordinator",
        "sourceStart": 1103,
        "sourceEnd": 1345,
        "text": "No. They need to dry and then go into the kiln at the tutor's workshop. Participants can collect them from the library two weeks later. If a bowl cracks during firing, the tutor will explain what happened, but we cannot promise a replacement.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "57086c72e4d078617bb365c47fafdb0582197a08c192545bb2a1599dfddbc05d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1351,
        "sourceEnd": 1370,
        "text": "What about payment?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "4038a7dcb8aa1f8a4d57c2cb900a4dee86c4e86095d69cb7904851f7d271ae15",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "coordinator",
        "speaker": "Coordinator",
        "sourceStart": 1384,
        "sourceEnd": 1655,
        "text": "The fee includes clay and firing. The café is closed, so tea is included too. We will ask people to bring lunch. If someone cancels at least three days before the session, we can return the fee. Later cancellations receive a refund only if another person takes the place.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "4ea286d42e5b8a9a7bd773db35c5e2f9f56b6b1922645072664d73570a2fc19b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1661,
        "sourceEnd": 1712,
        "text": "I will put those details in the confirmation email.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "b405a61b881ac52d9caa322953af213d592a2472b0b83313036f9a7067da0953",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      }
    ]
  },
